# Build context is the project root, which contains large notebooks, data and
# the 1.6 GB model weights. Ignore everything, then re-include only what the
# image actually needs (weights and references are mounted at runtime).

*

!ThirdParty
!utils
!measurements
!experiment_config_template.json
!do_preparation.py
!do_matching.py
!do_measurements.py
!docker

# Re-exclude heavy / generated content inside the re-included folders
ThirdParty/model_weights
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
ThirdParty/romatch.egg-info
docker/docker-compose.yml
docker/README.md
